# Mutation plan for createPost with a link: `crates/mm-app/src/link_metadata.rs` (link selection,
# getLinkMetadata, getEmbedForPost, getImagesForPost, the link cache), the permalink branch of
# `publishWebsocketEventForPost` and its hook, `SanitizePostMetadataForUser`, and the outbound
# headers. Unit lines are caught by `link_metadata::` against fixtures/behaviour_link_preview.json;
# api lines by `parity::post_create_links` against scripts/go-links.sh and a mock website.
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/post-links.plan
#
# The last two lines are no-op controls. `sanitize-keeps-a-hidden-preview` survives by design: on
# the create path the publish has already removed a preview the author may not read — see the doc
# comment on `App::sanitize_created_post_metadata_for_user`. First run 2026-09-19: 22 run, 18
# caught; `cached-image-not-svg-filtered` then caught by the test added for it.
